msgstr "O serviço de otimização por jogo falhou, então os jogos não estão sendo otimizados."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/overview.rs:228
msgid "The per-game optimization service failed. Logs show why; turning Turbo off and on again restarts it."
msgstr "O serviço de otimização por jogo falhou. Registros mostra o motivo; desligar e ligar o Turbo de novo o reinicia."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/game_fields.rs:1423
msgid "The performance overlay for this game. On uses MangoHud's Vulkan layer, which covers Vulkan and every Proton game; Forced uses its wrapper, which also reaches OpenGL games. It is written where the game's launcher reads it: Steam's launch options (with Steam closed), the game's settings in Heroic (with Heroic closed) or in Lutris."
